Comment: 0,0:16:04.38,0:16:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.41,0:16:07.99,pos,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华康手札体W5-A\frz323.2\c&H000000&\pos(574.667,589.333)}注册
