Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.28,0:16:11.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fad(200,200)\fn华康手札体W5-A\c&H000000&\frz336.7\pos(381.333,510.665)}echoes
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.74,0:16:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\bord0\fad(200,200)\fn@华康手札体W5-A\c&H000000&\frz229.5\pos(333.333,398.666)}骗人
